Package: EuroleagueBasketball
Title: EuroLeague Basketball Data Package
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Natasa", "Anastasiadou", , "anastasiadounat@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides EuroLeague Basketball team statistics, including
    historical results, titles, Final Four appearances, and other
    performance data.  Includes built-in datasets and visualizations for
    exploring EuroLeague trends.
